{"symbol":"SVLL","yahoo":"SVLL.NS","bse":null,"isin":"INE00CE01017","name":"Shree Vasu Logistics Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Trucking","website":"https://www.shreevasulogistics.com","about":"Shree Vasu Logistics Limited engages in the logistics business in India. The company operates through Logistics, Warehousing and Allied services; and Retail Trade segments. It also offers carrying and forwarding agency, warehouse renting, packaging, transportation and distribution services, and third-party logistics solutions. In addition, the company provides rental and warehousing activities, providing end-to-end integrated supply chain solutions, including transportation, warehousing, real-time tracking, last-mile delivery, allied services, and value-added services. Further, it serves electronics, FMCG, e-commerce, paints, tyres, adhesives, auto parts, automobiles, healthcare, textile, project deliveries, trucking, agriculture, and pesticides industries. Shree Vasu Logistics Limited was founded in 1987 and is based in Raipur, India.","updated":"2026-09-25T13:41:38+00:00","quote":{"price":834.7,"prevClose":820.4,"marketCap":959.38,"high52":897.45,"low52":445.15,"pe":133.77,"bookValue":34.69,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":1.1494,"insiders":null,"institutions":null},"prices":{"dates":["2018-06-18","2018-06-19","2018-06-20","2018-06-21","2018-06-22","2018-06-25","2018-06-26","2018-06-27","2018-06-28","2018-06-29","2018-07-02","2018-07-03","2018-07-04","2018-07-05","2018-07-06","2018-07-09","2018-07-10","2018-07-11","2018-07-12","2018-07-13","2018-07-16","2018-07-17","2018-07-18","2018-07-19","2018-07-20","2018-07-23","2018-07-24","2018-07-25","2018-07-26","2018-07-27","2018-07-30","2018-07-31","2018-08-01","2018-08-02","2018-08-03","2018-08-06","2018-08-07","2018-08-08","2018-08-09","2018-08-10","2018-08-13","2018-08-14","2018-08-16","2018-08-17","2018-08-20","2018-08-21","2018-08-23","2018-08-24","2018-08-27","2018-08-28","2018-08-29","2018-08-30","2018-0